{
  "name": "Load-Bearing Newsletter Production",
  "metadata": {
    "instant": true,
    "version": 1,
    "designer": { "orphans": [] },
    "scenario": {
      "roundtrips": 1,
      "maxErrors": 3,
      "autoCommit": true,
      "autoCommitTriggerLast": true,
      "sequential": false,
      "confidential": false,
      "dataloss": false,
      "dlq": false,
      "freshVariables": false
    }
  },
  "scheduling": { "type": "immediately" },
  "flow": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "module": "gateway:CustomWebHook",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": { "hook": 2448234, "maxResults": 1 },
      "mapper": {},
      "filter": null,
      "routes": [],
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "interface": [
          { "name": "topic", "type": "text", "label": "Topic" },
          { "name": "tool_or_workflow", "type": "text", "label": "Tool or Workflow Tested" },
          { "name": "what_held", "type": "text", "label": "What Held Under Load" },
          { "name": "what_failed", "type": "text", "label": "What Failed" },
          { "name": "what_changed", "type": "text", "label": "What I Would Do Differently" },
          { "name": "key_points", "type": "text", "label": "Key Points (optional)" }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          { "name": "hook", "type": "hook:gateway-webhook", "label": "Webhook", "required": true }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "module": "anthropic-claude:createAMessage",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": { "__IMTCONN__": null },
      "mapper": {
        "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
        "max_tokens": 2000,
        "messages": [
          {
            "role": "user",
            "content": "Write a Load-Bearing newsletter issue.\n\nTopic: {{1.topic}}\nTool or workflow: {{1.tool_or_workflow}}\nWhat held under load: {{1.what_held}}\nWhat failed: {{1.what_failed}}\nWhat I would do differently: {{1.what_changed}}\nAdditional context: {{1.key_points}}\n\nStructure (600-800 words):\n1. The setup — specific situation, 2-3 sentences, no preamble\n2. What held — specific, not vague\n3. What did not hold — honest failure, no softening\n4. What I would do differently — one concrete action only\n\nEnd with: -- Kyle\n\nVoice rules: declarative minimalism. No hype. No 'and that's when I realized.' No performative vulnerability. No silver linings. State what happened and what it means for the reader."
          }
        ],
        "system": "You write as Kyle Rosebrook. Voice: direct, declarative, earned authority. Engineering metaphors feel natural, not forced. No motivational filler. No redemption arc. Load-Bearing is about AI tools and workflows tested under real operational conditions — what held, what did not, and what to do about it. The reader is a practitioner, not a beginner."
      },
      "filter": null,
      "routes": [],
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 300, "y": 0 },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:anthropic-claude",
            "label": "Claude Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "module": "google-docs:createADocument",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": { "__IMTCONN__": null },
      "mapper": {
        "name": "{{formatDate(now; \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}} — LB Draft — {{1.topic}}",
        "content": "{{2.content[1].text}}",
        "destination": "drive",
        "header": false,
        "footer": false,
        "folderId": "/"
      },
      "filter": null,
      "routes": [],
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 600, "y": 0 },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:google",
            "label": "Google Connection",
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "module": "gmail:createADraft",
      "version": 1,
      "parameters": { "__IMTCONN__": null },
      "mapper": {
        "to": "kylerosebrook@gmail.com",
        "subject": "[LB Draft Ready] {{1.topic}} — {{formatDate(now; \"YYYY-MM-DD\")}}",
        "body": "Newsletter draft is ready for review.\n\nTopic: {{1.topic}}\nDoc link: https://docs.google.com/document/d/{{3.documentId}}/edit\n\nReview, edit, and schedule when ready.",
        "contentType": "text"
      },
      "filter": null,
      "routes": [],
      "metadata": {
        "designer": { "x": 900, "y": 0 },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "__IMTCONN__",
            "type": "account:google",
            "label": "Gmail Connection (Google)",
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "interface": { "input": [], "output": [] }
}
